			title: "Fluorite Vein"
			x: 1.25d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3FB9EA4152DCD1D3"]
			description: [
				"The End's pitchblende vein has been there all along, and no drill will touch it: you'll dissolve the uranium right out of the rock."
