			title: "First Criticality"
			x: 22.75d
			y: 0.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["72139ED6F4E46D37"]
			description: ["A spent assembly still holds uranium and the plutonium it bred. The hot cell's circuit 3 dissolves it in nitric acid and hands back both. The waste is glassed and kept."]
