		{
			dependencies: ["7E266AE6DB3351F7"]
			description: ["Plutonium oxide sealed in platinum and rhodium foil stays warm on its own. The hot cell's circuit 2 makes an &6RTG Pellet&r, as close to a pocket sun as GregTech allows."]
