		{
			dependencies: ["5A1DBDF9E739CEF2", "148A0854C671B0AC"]
			description: ["Circuit 1 makes a concentrate from ice and steam, and circuit 2 finishes it into &6Heavy Water&r. Any steam works, and the combined-cycle plant has plenty it isn't allowed to throw away."]
