		{
			dependencies: ["18E80E32AB01B8F6"]
			description: ["The hiss the Moon's antenna picked up from Sagittarius finally has an address: one faint, steady point at the centre of the galaxy. The &6Sagittarius A* Signal&r is a long way off, and you're going anyway."]
			icon: "grindless:sagittarius_a_star_signal"
			id: "5EC977A2B65C7030"
			rewards: [{ id: "774D93C481898591", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "1AAEB14578BC22FC", item: "grindless:sagittarius_a_star_signal", type: "item" }]
			title: "Sagittarius A*"
			x: 68.75d
			y: 2.75d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["18E80E32AB01B8F6", "305FCC7C554A03CC"]
			description: [
				"Rhodium plated palladium, niobium titanium cable and PTFE make the &6LuV Machine Hull&r, and yes, it's another hull."
				"Venus's naquadah and Mercury's iridium got you here, and the new chart points further out still."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:luv_machine_hull"
			id: "77B4DDD47050E3C7"
			rewards: [{ id: "358DA1420D38DA14", type: "xp", xp: 300 }]
			shape: "diamond"
			size: 1.75d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "3479FAA22560FB08", item: "gtceu:luv_machine_hull", type: "item" }
				{ id: "7CDE3969BB8E33F5", item: "gtceu:naquadah_ingot", type: "item" }
				{ id: "1A5AEC03B954F82D", item: "grindless:outer_system_chart", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Gate to LuV"
			x: 67.75d
			y: 1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5FD0B9548159D199"]
			description: [
				"The leach field no longer hands you rock, only a pale &6Uranyl Sulfate Liquor&r pumped out of the pitchblende. It's the start of the long way round to enriched uranium, the one the hot cell folds into a single recipe."
				"Pipe it out of the field and keep a tank of it ready for the next step."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:uranyl_sulfate_liquor_bucket"
			id: "72950A35E94ED64F"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{ id: "53AD72011AAF2C00", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "7CF10CBD338C0952", item: "gtceu:uranyl_sulfate_liquor_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Uranyl Liquor"
			x: 6.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["72950A35E94ED64F"]
			description: [
				"A large chemical reactor passes the liquor over ion-exchange resin, which grabs the uranium and lets everything else go. What comes out is &6Uranium Eluate&r, plus diluted sulfuric acid you can recycle."
				"Feed the resin and the liquor from buses, and send the acid back to the plant."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:uranium_eluate_bucket"
			id: "30ED21805A9D7D52"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{ id: "546CAD39F5DD5978", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "1254C12FE3E50048", item: "gtceu:uranium_eluate_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Uranium Eluate"
			x: 8.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["30ED21805A9D7D52"]
			description: [
				"Hydrogen peroxide drops the uranium out of the eluate as &6Yellowcake&r, and the sulfuric acid comes back for another round. A chemical reactor does it, and a pump on the acid line closes the loop."
				"Yellowcake is the form uranium ships in, which is why it sounds so ominous."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:yellowcake_dust"
			id: "3EE025908022C81B"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{ id: "7E2B26299BD28578", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "5D077F6129948F04", item: "gtceu:yellowcake_dust", type: "item" }]
			title: "Yellowcake"
			x: 10.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3EE025908022C81B"]
			description: [
				"An electric blast furnace at the lower coil tier roasts the yellowcake into &6Triuranium Octoxide&r, the stable oxide. It needs a steady heat and nothing else, so one furnace fed by a bus keeps it going."
				"Next it gets reduced."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:triuranium_octoxide_dust"
			id: "3D922EF8A7A71BA8"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{ id: "58016706B9019D4E", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "346A16666806E5B9", item: "gtceu:triuranium_octoxide_dust", type: "item" }]
			title: "Triuranium Octoxide"
			x: 12.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3D922EF8A7A71BA8"]
			description: [
				"Hydrogen strips oxygen off the oxide in a hotter blast furnace, and out comes clean &6Uraninite&r, ready to take fluorine. Run the hydrogen from your electrolysers and the furnace needs no attention."
				"Yes, you've now made uraninite from uraninite. The detour was the point."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:uraninite_dust"
			id: "32C246F3F710DDCA"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{ id: "560C5C5B949CECE5", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "3161F93387DCC0A6", item: "gtceu:uraninite_dust", type: "item" }]
			title: "Uraninite Again"
			x: 14.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["32C246F3F710DDCA"]
			description: [
				"Uraninite and hydrofluoric acid meet in a large chemical reactor and make &6Uranium Tetrafluoride&r, the green salt. The HF is the kiln's, so keep it flowing by pipe."
				"From here the fluorine is the whole story."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:uranium_tetrafluoride_dust"
			id: "3E95F7B29EEF175F"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{ id: "3DEE5A8F6996D6C1", type: "xp", xp: 40 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "79769BB32ED273FC", item: "gtceu:uranium_tetrafluoride_dust", type: "item" }]
			title: "Uranium Tetrafluoride"
			x: 16.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3E95F7B29EEF175F"]
			description: [
				"Fluorine takes the tetrafluoride up to &6Uranium Hexafluoride&r, a gas at the temperatures that matter, and that's exactly what a centrifuge wants. Pipe the fluorine from your electrolysis line."
				"It is also nasty stuff, so keep it in tanks."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:uranium_hexafluoride_bucket"
			id: "1C25A2FDF954027C"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{ id: "1DE860E6DA70AF57", type: "xp", xp: 40 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "504C872B38F45FB7", item: "gtceu:uranium_hexafluoride_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Uranium Hexafluoride"
			x: 18.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1C25A2FDF954027C"]
			description: [
				"A centrifuge splits the gas into &6Enriched UF6&r and a depleted stream, and a last large chemical reactor with steam and hydrogen turns each into dust and gives the fluorine back as HF. That's the whole of circuit 1 in the hot cell, unfolded."
				"Automate it and the hot cell becomes a luxury."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:enriched_uranium_hexafluoride_bucket"
			id: "58CC8D75DBD62574"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{ id: "33FCC6F97ABFC00B", type: "xp", xp: 50 }]
			tasks: [
				{ id: "5CBFA0055053FECD", item: "gtceu:enriched_uranium_hexafluoride_bucket", type: "item" }
				{ id: "7F5D5D67F24D7478", item: "gtceu:depleted_uranium_hexafluoride_bucket", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Spun and Split"
			x: 20.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["77A25AB4BB859C79"]
			description: [
				"Zircaloy tubes start as the End's red zircon. A chemical reactor chlorinates it with carbon and chlorine into &6Zr-Hf Chloride&r, with zirconium and hafnium still together."
				"Feed it from a zircon drill line and the chlorine from your electrolysers."
			]
			icon: "grindless:zr_hf_chloride_dust"
			id: "10FDDB217295CE41"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{ id: "563357267D127F75", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			tasks: [
				{ id: "5A918551CC691F3B", item: "gtca:red_zircon_dust", type: "item" }
				{ id: "1D3300715D294061", item: "grindless:zr_hf_chloride_dust", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Zircon Chloride"
			x: 5.75d
			y: -5.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["10FDDB217295CE41"]
			description: [
				"Hafnium eats neutrons, so a reactor wants zirconium without it. The extraction cascade splits the chloride into &6Zirconium Chloride&r and hafnium chloride, and you'll want to keep the hafnium for much later."
				"Set circuit 8 and let it run from a bus."
			]
			icon: "grindless:zirconium_chloride_dust"
			id: "7AB284E7415B1B48"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{ id: "3F2F11CA385F72E8", type: "xp", xp: 40 }]
			tasks: [
				{ id: "7072BA04371C4D82", item: "grindless:zirconium_chloride_dust", type: "item" }
				{ id: "1A51AADFE520CD08", item: "grindless:hafnium_chloride_dust", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Zirconium without Hafnium"
			x: 7.75d
			y: -5.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7AB284E7415B1B48"]
			description: [
				"Magnesium reduces the chloride to &6Zirconium Sponge&r in the fuel fabrication plant, under argon. The sponge is what the mixer wants."
				"Keep a bus of magnesium dust beside it."
			]
			icon: "grindless:zirconium_sponge"
			id: "571BC6BEA49E80B4"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{ id: "7D0B959EB1E3769B", type: "xp", xp: 40 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "7D5C051CEB3ECCAD", item: "grindless:zirconium_sponge", type: "item" }]
			title: "Zirconium Sponge"
			x: 9.75d
			y: -5.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["571BC6BEA49E80B4"]
			description: [
				"A mixer folds the sponge together with a little tin into &6Zircaloy&r, tough enough to hold fuel and invisible to neutrons. Melt it into ingots and roll tubes for the LEU assembly."
				"Automate it and the fuel line never starves for cladding."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:zircaloy_ingot"
			id: "5BFA3C91B22A0A4C"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{ id: "1F6FF03EE50FED5C", type: "xp", xp: 50 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "3407F97DF77121DA", item: "gtceu:zircaloy_ingot", type: "item" }]
			title: "Zircaloy"
			x: 11.75d
			y: -5.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7E266AE6DB3351F7"]
			description: [
				"The plutonium you reprocessed goes back to work. Circuit 2 in the hot cell blends it with uranium into a &6MOX Fuel Assembly&r, and the reactor burns it like any other fuel."
				"Feed the spent assemblies back in by bus and the loop closes: fuel goes in, power comes out, waste becomes fuel."
			]
			icon: "grindless:mox_fuel_assembly"
			id: "344E7865AFE4DE0D"
			rewards: [{ id: "536D42575EA55EE7", type: "xp", xp: 80 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "5F11A7F3569A06F3", item: "grindless:mox_fuel_assembly", type: "item" }]
			title: "MOX Fuel"
			x: 26.75d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["344E7865AFE4DE0D"]
			description: [
				"A &6Breeder Fuel Assembly&r from the hot cell, circuit 2 again, makes more plutonium than it uses. Run one beside the MOX loop and your reprocessor never runs dry."
				"Not free energy, just patience."
			]
			icon: "grindless:breeder_fuel_assembly"
			id: "3EAA3FBD8795A8DB"
			rewards: [{ id: "170F0C133BAA11C8", type: "xp", xp: 80 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "12F3151C699DB6CE", item: "grindless:breeder_fuel_assembly", type: "item" }]
			title: "Breeder Assembly"
			x: 28.75d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7E266AE6DB3351F7"]
			description: [
				"The thermal suit needs fabric that survives Mercury, and that means polybenzimidazole. It starts with &6Chlorobenzene&r from benzene and chlorine in a chemical reactor."
				"Pipe the benzene from your oil line and the chlorine from the electrolysers."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:chlorobenzene_bucket"
			id: "5A33EE3D00497E1E"
			rewards: [{ id: "3C9815C6AC03C361", type: "xp", xp: 40 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "362C244EB17AA942", item: "gtceu:chlorobenzene_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Chlorobenzene"
			x: 26.0d
			y: 4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5A33EE3D00497E1E"]
			description: [
				"Nitration mixture adds the nitro groups and gives &6Nitrochlorobenzene&r. Keep the acids in dedicated tanks."
				"Automate it with a pump per acid."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:nitrochlorobenzene_bucket"
			id: "1E9EC2AF5DED6169"
			rewards: [{ id: "3150870169E58F0E", type: "xp", xp: 40 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "5B61C95AA9B2FC7D", item: "gtceu:nitrochlorobenzene_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Nitrochlorobenzene"
			x: 28.0d
			y: 4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1E9EC2AF5DED6169"]
			description: [
				"Two rings join into &6Dichlorobenzidine&r, a step closer to the polymer."
				"A single chemical reactor with the right circuit keeps up if you feed it by pipe."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:dichlorobenzidine_bucket"
			id: "322B526A30805D80"
			rewards: [{ id: "7E79914D6679D391", type: "xp", xp: 40 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "5F6EF00423CCBA06", item: "gtceu:dichlorobenzidine_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Dichlorobenzidine"
			x: 30.0d
			y: 4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["322B526A30805D80"]
			description: [
				"Ammonia swaps the chlorines for amines and leaves &6Diaminobenzidine&r, one of the two halves of PBI."
				"The other half is the isophthalate branch just below."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:diaminobenzidine_bucket"
			id: "34D40E52EC3B7994"
			rewards: [{ id: "7AD477D4B135A35F", type: "xp", xp: 40 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "1FEF03BB3E785357", item: "gtceu:diaminobenzidine_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Diaminobenzidine"
			x: 32.0d
			y: 4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1E9EC2AF5DED6169"]
			description: [
				"Phenol and phthalic acid combine into &6Diphenyl Isophthalate&r, the other half of the polymer. Make it beside the diaminobenzidine and let both pipes meet at the polymerizer."
				"Phenol is easy once you have a coal tar line."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:diphenyl_isophthalate_bucket"
			id: "5B32D9128788FA5F"
			rewards: [{ id: "76CB638C829BB148", type: "xp", xp: 40 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "5CB8C5DD9CA5AAA5", item: "gtceu:diphenyl_isophthalate_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Diphenyl Isophthalate"
			x: 31.0d
			y: 6.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["34D40E52EC3B7994", "5B32D9128788FA5F"]
			description: [
				"The two halves react into liquid &6Polybenzimidazole&r, the plastic that laughs at heat. Run both feeds from tanks and the reactor sets its own pace."
				"Next it gets cast and rolled."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:polybenzimidazole_bucket"
			id: "39442B3BEA24CCC3"
			rewards: [{ id: "7FF192A9BB37BBC9", type: "xp", xp: 60 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "18090CD222D8AA8D", item: "gtceu:polybenzimidazole_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Polybenzimidazole"
			x: 34.0d
			y: 4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["39442B3BEA24CCC3"]
			description: [
				"Cast the fluid into ingots, then roll them into &6PBI Foil&r. A foil line off a bender keeps up with the fabric assembler."
				"Para-aramid and PTFE foil are the other two layers."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:polybenzimidazole_foil"
			id: "7AABD30EE6634C08"
			rewards: [{ id: "364F191B0288B4A1", type: "xp", xp: 60 }]
			tasks: [
				{ id: "16CB976903F6C767", item: "gtceu:polybenzimidazole_ingot", type: "item" }
				{ id: "30C9DA2562FB3069", item: "gtceu:polybenzimidazole_foil", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "PBI Foil"
			x: 36.0d
			y: 4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7AABD30EE6634C08"]
			description: [
				"An assembler layers PBI, para-aramid and PTFE foil into &6Insulating Fabric&r, which goes into the thermal suit's smithing template. Build a small foil bus so one assembler makes them all."
				"Mercury will test it."
			]
			icon: "gcyr:insulating_fabric"
			id: "3B013256ED81A3A9"
			rewards: [{ id: "1132F5C590F8772A", type: "xp", xp: 80 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "5C363C0AA0C43D0A", item: "gcyr:insulating_fabric", type: "item" }]
			title: "Insulating Fabric"
			x: 39.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["77FF1E1CF59D10BC"]
			description: [
				"Raw naquadah is ground and washed into an &6Oxide Mixture&r that the plant takes in circuit 1. It also needs a neutron source, and gallium and titanium come out as byproducts."
				"Feed it by bus and the plant runs unattended."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:naquadah_oxide_mixture_dust"
			id: "7ADD2278E31A240E"
			rewards: [{ id: "30449165558F0834", type: "xp", xp: 50 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "3E10ED15480F9239", item: "gtceu:naquadah_oxide_mixture_dust", type: "item" }]
			title: "Oxide Mixture"
			x: 55.0d
			y: -2.75d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7ADD2278E31A240E", "14C75CDBACADEE5A"]
			description: [
				"The plant turns the mixture into &6Naquadah Dust&r, which then goes to the blast furnace for the hot ingot. That's the very start of the quantum wafers."
				"Keep the byproduct hatches emptied or the plant stalls."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:naquadah_dust"
			id: "35D0E940C0A997B4"
			rewards: [{ id: "7292F9DD810CA5DB", type: "xp", xp: 60 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "542952CFC9171BE1", item: "gtceu:naquadah_dust", type: "item" }]
			title: "Naquadah Dust"
			x: 58.25d
			y: -2.75d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["171D167E3CB497BB"]
			description: [
				"The platinum plant on circuit 3 hides a long chain. Unfolded, it starts in the solar works: iridosmine is fused into a &6Rarest Metal Mixture&r and osmium tetroxide."
				"Build it if you want the real thing; the plant will do the rest."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:rarest_metal_mixture_dust"
			id: "366A06483B5FCF08"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{ id: "10D6EE832011F725", type: "xp", xp: 40 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "3556FB7F0F87B56F", item: "gtceu:rarest_metal_mixture_dust", type: "item" }]
			title: "Rarest Metal Mixture"
			x: 54.75d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["366A06483B5FCF08"]
			description: [
				"The fusion also gives &6Osmium Tetroxide&r, which is toxic and must stay in tanks. Reduce it to osmium and you have the other half of the line."
				"Never vent it."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:osmium_tetroxide_bucket"
			id: "10AD66A112A6CA9C"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{ id: "75DDF419EBF9DF63", type: "xp", xp: 40 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "1EBA4C59AF8096D3", item: "gtceu:osmium_tetroxide_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Osmium Tetroxide"
			x: 56.0d
			y: 5.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["10AD66A112A6CA9C"]
			description: [
				"Reduce the tetroxide and cast the &6Osmium&r ingots. Osmium is among the densest metals and will make rotors and armour later."
				"A tank-fed reactor handles it."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:osmium_ingot"
			id: "7BC9481B61245FCE"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{ id: "1235BA7C169BB09A", type: "xp", xp: 50 }]
			tasks: [
				{ id: "58AF556899E47904", item: "gtceu:osmium_dust", type: "item" }
				{ id: "5FDC2C568E3A9A89", item: "gtceu:osmium_ingot", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Osmium"
			x: 57.25d
			y: 5.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["366A06483B5FCF08"]
			description: [
				"A blast furnace burns the mixture down to &6Iridium Metal Residue&r, the stubborn rest of the platinum group."
				"One furnace on a bus covers it."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:iridium_metal_residue_dust"
			id: "3CA5AE7AE68D8B1B"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{ id: "3CCBE9D8D9739536", type: "xp", xp: 40 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "50CB51FF40315FD1", item: "gtceu:iridium_metal_residue_dust", type: "item" }]
			title: "Iridium Residue"
			x: 56.0d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3CA5AE7AE68D8B1B"]
			description: [
				"Processing the residue gives &6Iridium Dioxide&r."
				"Feed it to the next reactor in line."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:iridium_dioxide_dust"
			id: "1DD88D65C232A993"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{ id: "1558CA1100347968", type: "xp", xp: 40 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "3A14B9A205E83360", item: "gtceu:iridium_dioxide_dust", type: "item" }]
			title: "Iridium Dioxide"
			x: 57.25d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
