			x: 66.5d
			y: -2.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["11004E2A89BF9FDD"]
			description: ["A naquadah wafer under a purple lens becomes the &6Advanced SoC Wafer&r, and the cutter turns it into &6Advanced SoCs&r. The IV laser engraver, a purple lens, a cutter with lubricant or water, and a cleanroom. Advanced SoCs, for the quantum processor's faster recipe and the parts that ask for them. A wafer in, chips out. Keep lenses in the engraver and lubricant on a pipe."]
			icon: "gtceu:advanced_soc_wafer"
			id: "3F7082E01EF2836F"
			rewards: [{ id: "50F55D61F5063F6F", type: "xp", xp: 60 }]
