		{
			dependencies: ["77A25AB4BB859C79"]
			description: ["The &6Hot Cell&r is where uranium stops being something you carry around. Its controller, which takes a Zircaloy cladding tube pressed at the Fuel Fabrication Plant, and Radiation-Proof Machine Casing, lead-heavy blocks from the IV assembler, set in concrete. Enrichment, fuel, reprocessing and every radioactive step after it. It rides in and out on buses, and the programmed circuit picks the job."]
			icon: "gtceu:hot_cell"
			id: "30D78F6EB49AF27B"
			rewards: [{ id: "3C46C7FFD0C53F21", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
