			x: 14.5d
			y: -0.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["13366823FB3362E0"]
			description: ["Real fuel is pellets in metal tubes, pressed, sintered and sealed with helium, and the &6Fuel Fabrication Plant&r does the whole line. Its controller, built around an IV assembler. Maybe make two. LEU, MOX and breeder assemblies. The circuit picks the step. Feed it from the hot cell by ME."]
			icon: "gtceu:fuel_fabrication_plant"
			id: "77A25AB4BB859C79"
