			y: 1.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["77B6F588980A4B1C"]
			description: ["Four wells push acid into the rock, one pulls the uranium back up, and resin in the header house catches it. The &6In-Situ Leach Field&r only works in the End. Its controller, ion-exchange resin, and the five wells, which you do dig yourself. Uraninite, and with it enrichment. The sample is never used up and the resin wears slowly. Waste goes into storage."]
			icon: "gtceu:isr_wellfield"
			id: "5FD0B9548159D199"
			rewards: [{ id: "149CFF6CA016D569", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ count: 4L, id: "145EB8F6C8FA1CE7", item: "grindless:ion_exchange_resin", type: "item" }
				{ id: "728859161ED9D148", item: "gtceu:isr_wellfield", type: "item" }
				{ count: 30L, id: "79E8F6CCA799617C", item: "gtceu:uraninite_dust", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "In-Situ Leach Field"
			x: 5.25d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["72139ED6F4E46D37"]
			description: ["The &6Heavy-Water Plant&r squeezes heavy water out of Martian ice with two towers and a hydrogen sulfide loop. Its controller, built around a distillation tower. Heavy water, the heavy-water core and deuterium. The hydrogen sulfide only circulates, so one fill lasts forever."]
			icon: "gtceu:heavy_water_plant"
			id: "5A1DBDF9E739CEF2"
			rewards: [{ id: "5F8C266CF793BE87", type: "xp", xp: 80 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "10DA8F0D9F79521C", item: "gtceu:heavy_water_plant", type: "item" }]
			title: "Heavy-Water Plant"
			x: 25.0d
			y: -1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["373CBFB746FCAD51", "79EE0C54F2D89358"]
			description: ["On the Moon, a cold box between two exchange columns pulls the tritium out and hands the heavy water back. The &6Tritium Removal Facility&r is built from a cryogenic plant controller. Its controller and a deuterium charge that is never drained. The only tritium in the pack, and the Inner Planets Chart. Run it at night with every radiator open to the sky and it costs half."]
			icon: "gtceu:tritium_removal_facility"
			id: "32FD8F32DC829A03"
			rewards: [{ id: "17FAB180D4483A10", type: "xp", xp: 80 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "7189AAE4EC2E25D7", item: "gtceu:tritium_removal_facility", type: "item" }]
			title: "Tritium Removal Facility"
			x: 34.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1D931CB1451E8B5A"]
			description: [
				"The &6RTG Cell&r is a pellet behind lead with a thermopile and some fins, and it works on every world, day and night, because it burns nothing."
				"Each pellet lasts about an hour of running, and its EV power starts the first bases on Venus and Mercury."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:ev_rtg"
			id: "503863FFACA225A8"
			rewards: [{ id: "3C923ADDA8C8C6ED", type: "xp", xp: 60 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "3F60C55B76B5440E", item: "gtceu:ev_rtg", type: "item" }]
			title: "RTG Cell"
			x: 27.75d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5693331C34A5A291", "74BC8201D518D3BA"]
			description: ["A gas collector above the cloud base fills up with the clouds' sulfuric acid, and the &6Venus Acid Works&r cracks it over a hot gauze. Its controller and platinum gauze. Distilled water and oxygen for every Venus base. Circuit 1 lets the sulfur dioxide back into the sky; circuit 2 keeps it for chemistry at home."]
			icon: "gtceu:venus_acid_works"
			id: "534239273A7CA7FC"
			rewards: [{ id: "572134865D4A4664", type: "xp", xp: 80 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ count: 2L, id: "1287751A6EB4FFF6", item: "grindless:platinum_gauze", type: "item" }
				{ id: "36F87FDE80673760", item: "gtceu:venus_acid_works", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Venus Acid Works"
			x: 46.75d
			y: 0.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["534239273A7CA7FC"]
			description: ["No fuel burns here, but the ground is a furnace. A hot plate and a tall radiator run the &6Venus Heat Engine&r on a trickle of distilled water. Its controller, built from a Heliostat Tower and a Large Steam Turbine. Venus power with nothing to burn. It is always noon on Venus. Let the surplus go home over the bridge."]
			icon: "gtceu:venus_heat_engine"
			id: "5669D88DE37D633F"
			rewards: [{ id: "1502AD29A55FFF56", type: "xp", xp: 80 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "5D53479A80F0DEEA", item: "gtceu:venus_heat_engine", type: "item" }]
			title: "Venus Heat Engine"
			x: 50.75d
			y: -0.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7FCCB79E1561AAAB", "1B1714A8E0124C58", "5107982325BE34B7"]
			description: ["The &6Pressurized Vein Drill&r is an EV Tripod Drill rebuilt for ninety bar, with filters for the dust and water to carry off the heat. Its controller and tungsten steel drill bits from the IV lathe. Venus's naquadah and Mars's three veins. On Venus each run drinks distilled water and breathes out steam."]
			icon: "gtceu:pressurized_vein_drill"
			id: "7DCDEF4DEDB8B607"
			rewards: [{ id: "11595F8291C955B4", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ count: 16L, id: "1D9C22B784E469D1", item: "grindless:tungsten_steel_drill_bit", type: "item" }
				{ id: "7E3C0B4D43F671A7", item: "gtceu:pressurized_vein_drill", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Pressurized Vein Drill"
			x: 50.25d
			y: -2.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["77FF1E1CF59D10BC", "3FCAFC1E38DD934C"]
			description: ["The activator only makes naquadah while its neutron energy sits in a narrow window. The &6Naquadah Plant&r holds it with a Pu-Be source from the hot cell and brews its superacid inside. Its controller, a Pu-Be source and inert casing. Two EV hatches run it until Mercury's iridium. Naquadah dust, and the ingot that starts the quantum wafers. Outside the window you only get radioactive waste. Keep a source in the bus."]
			icon: "gtceu:naquadah_plant"
			id: "14C75CDBACADEE5A"
			rewards: [{ id: "1B5C80164B36B0BF", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "7EAD321802CCD64B", item: "grindless:pube_neutron_source", type: "item" }
				{ count: 16L, id: "761A7754A0B0B958", item: "gtceu:inert_machine_casing", type: "item" }
				{ id: "1436D6F3F1D96574", item: "gtceu:naquadah_plant", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Naquadah Plant"
			x: 56.5d
			y: -1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["55613604E4C62B5F"]
			description: ["Eight heliostat mirrors stand around a focal furnace on a pad of smelted Mercury rock, and the &6Mercury Solar Works&r pays a quarter of the power when the sun is on the receiver. Its controller, built from a Heliostat Tower, an IV electric furnace and an IV assembler, and the mirrors. Heat-shield bricks and the thin-film panels. Every mirror needs open sky. Run it by day."]
			icon: "gtceu:mercury_solar_works"
			id: "32D53F1384080352"
			rewards: [{ id: "5C5208A2A067F190", type: "xp", xp: 80 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ count: 8L, id: "787D29A202C69193", item: "grindless:heliostat_mirror", type: "item" }
				{ id: "7A3550A4E4D7A9CE", item: "gtceu:mercury_solar_works", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Mercury Solar Works"
			x: 46.25d
			y: 2.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["15320440D70D86A7", "734B97375A3121C4"]
			description: ["The works evaporates gallium arsenide onto silicon in free vacuum, and that is a thin-film panel. The &6Mercury Solar Field&r is built from a Lunar Solar Array. Its controller and thin-film panels. Solar power for Mercury by day. It works by day only, with programmed circuit 1 in its bus. At night the RTG cell or the bridge carries the base."]
			icon: "gtceu:mercury_solar_field"
			id: "1BADC15A1CDF6CF1"
			rewards: [{ id: "15A41AF73BDDE980", type: "xp", xp: 80 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ count: 36L, id: "3EED1EA726C178E9", item: "grindless:hermean_thin_film_panel", type: "item" }
				{ id: "56F6690958962969", item: "gtceu:mercury_solar_field", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Mercury Solar Field"
			x: 53.0d
			y: 0.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["15320440D70D86A7", "5107982325BE34B7"]
			description: ["The &6Mercury Vein Drill&r is an EV Tripod Drill under a brick sunshade. Its controller and an iridosmine vein sample. Raw iridosmine, the only iridium and osmium in the system. By day it only drills with liquid nitrogen from the Moon. At night it drills dry and the bit wears faster."]
			icon: "gtceu:mercury_vein_drill"
			id: "171D167E3CB497BB"
			rewards: [{ id: "33FB4BF44D9D5A19", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "32CC310BCEB8F732", item: "grindless:vein_sample_iridosmine_mercury", type: "item" }
				{ id: "7D3CC20D12EC6E79", item: "gtceu:mercury_vein_drill", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Mercury Vein Drill"
			x: 54.25d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["72E1760292CBF88F"]
			description: [
				"Iridium is what IV energy and dynamo hatches were waiting for. Until now two EV hatches ran any IV multiblock; from here one IV hatch does the same job with half the wiring."
				"Swap them in at your own pace. Nothing breaks if you don't."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:iv_energy_input_hatch"
			id: "1CA4E08CA2FFA8E6"
			rewards: [{ id: "509DF1CDCB67F68C", type: "xp", xp: 60 }]
			tasks: [
				{ count: 2L, id: "318D086DCEE35FAE", item: "gtceu:iv_energy_input_hatch", type: "item" }
				{ id: "5B0CB55AEBE68A17", item: "gtceu:iv_energy_output_hatch", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "IV Hatches"
			x: 60.25d
			y: 1.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1CA4E08CA2FFA8E6", "5940CA99055BAF42"]
			description: ["The &6Interferometer&r is three dishes on Mercury listening as one, with a baseline that reaches back to the Moon. Its controller, built around a spare Deep Space Antenna. Its IV sensors and emitters take iridium and Quantum Stars. The Outer System Chart. It only listens at night."]
			icon: "gtceu:interferometer"
			id: "5EB98498505C969F"
			rewards: [{ id: "1B28D3E12EE03372", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "538A915139D19F46", item: "gtceu:interferometer", type: "item" }]
			title: "Interferometer"
			x: 63.5d
			y: 2.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1CA4E08CA2FFA8E6"]
			description: [
				"An &6Elite Parallel Control Hatch&r runs up to four copies of a recipe at once, in GCYM's machines and in the hot cell and the fuel, heavy-water, naquadah and platinum plants."
				"Each copy pays full price, so four copies of an IV recipe want two IV energy hatches. The naquadah and platinum plants also want a Pu-Be source or electrode per copy."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:iv_parallel_hatch"
			id: "14E966D3D6D326FE"
			rewards: [{ id: "7CC65CD197D3836C", type: "xp", xp: 60 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "57C7416223D5E0C7", item: "gtceu:iv_parallel_hatch", type: "item" }]
			title: "Parallel Hatch"
			x: 61.25d
			y: 2.75d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["13366823FB3362E0"]
			description: ["The &6Smelting Complex&r runs the blast furnace and the vacuum freezer as one recipe, so a hot ingot never has to be carried between machines. Its controller. EMI shows which ingots it takes. Every blast-furnace metal that wants a freezer next. Feed it dust and fluids by ME, and let the ingots go straight to storage."]
			icon: "gtceu:smelting_complex"
			id: "14682D455D2C4F7C"
			rewards: [
				{ id: "52B8203B59E741DD", type: "xp", xp: 80 }
				{ count: 16, id: "1985410D948A065C", item: "gtceu:steel_ingot", type: "item" }
			]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "3BA9AEBF2A6DBAF3", item: "gtceu:smelting_complex", type: "item" }]
			title: "Smelting Complex"
			x: 3.25d
			y: -0.75d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["71E4B392A6D559D9"]
			description: [
				"A quantum ring and a link chamber at home and the seed's twin on Venus give you a pair, and the ME network crosses worlds. Do the same on Mercury with its own seed."
				"Power travels over EU P2P as EU, with 16 A IV hatches at each end carrying 131,072 EU/t. AE2 takes a 2.5% toll."
			]
			icon: "ae2:quantum_ring"
			id: "11672E9A925C2B92"
			rewards: [{ id: "3D0E90763432C049", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			tasks: [
				{ count: 8L, id: "73F6B9FF7AB598CB", item: "ae2:quantum_ring", type: "item" }
				{ id: "7ED10E2041417C4D", item: "ae2:quantum_link", type: "item" }
				{ count: 2L, id: "38EBE38827C561D0", item: "ae2:me_p2p_tunnel", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Network Across Worlds"
			x: 48.5d
			y: -2.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["14E966D3D6D326FE"]
			description: ["The large halls of the IV era: boilers, smelters, chemistry, forming and assembly, one theme to a row."]
			icon: "gtceu:large_assembler"
			id: "554415D1C549C18E"
			rewards: [ ]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 0.75d
